<title>UK: Die Westhyp sets 100 million mark structured bond.</title>
<headline>Die Westhyp sets 100 million mark structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.0 PCT   MATURITY    04.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  102.35    PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  NONE	LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEAR ONE, 81.0 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR REX SUB-INDEX</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF EMISSION 3928</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
